OL,3,GNEWSACCTV installed to deter vandals at
OL,4,Aderelict factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FVandalism at a derelict factory has
OL,7,Fprompted a council to install CCTV at
OL,8,Fthe site.
OL,10,FMid Suffolk District Council has
OL,11,Fbrought in the CCTV to deter
OL,12,Fanti-social behaviour at the Fisons
OL,13,Fsite on Paper Mill Lane, Bramford,
OL,14,FIpswich, even though the owner, Paper
OL,15,FMill Lane Properties, was responsible
OL,16,Ffor its security.
OL,18,FThe Victorian former factory has seen a
OL,19,Fnumber of serious fires and vandalism
OL,20,Fover many years.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
