OL,3,GNEWSACCTV installed to deter vandals at
OL,4,Aderelict factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Stringer, the cabinet member for
OL,7,Fheritage planning and infrastructure at
OL,8,Fthe authority, said: "We share the
OL,9,Fcommunity's frustration at ongoing
OL,10,Fanti-social behaviour on the site."
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
